Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.33,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:41.88,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:46.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.56,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:57.81,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:02.11,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:07.78,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:13.01,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.50,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:20.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:24.02,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:29.27,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:32.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:36.51,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:38.54,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Até encontrar
